    <string name="cal_intro_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="cal_intro_body">Hold the device the way you do in practice — in hand or on a stand, about 30 cm from your mouth. Keep the distance the same for calibration and singing. First 2 seconds of silence, then 4 seconds of "ah" on a comfortable note at your usual volume.</string>
    <string name="cal_intro_relative">All metrics are relative: another device, distance or room needs a new calibration.</string>
